Sat Aug 29 08:18:21 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Initial package (version 0.1.2)
  * Needed by skillspector >= 2.11.0.
  * WPT URL conformance fixtures are not in the sdist; carried as
    separate sources pinned to the WPT commit upstream's CI uses, so
    %check runs the real conformance suite (1600 cases).
  * test_wpt_idna.py/test_wpt_toascii.py excluded from %check: they
    are xfail upstream because python-idna enforces RFC 5891/5892,
    stricter than WHATWG's lenient UTS46.

